  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電子元件實務應用",
    "sub_ename": "ELECTRONIC DEVICES LABORATORY",
    "describe_ch": "各類電子元件原理及應用面與元件量測實習, 包含元素及化合物半導體，各類光與電轉換元件之設計與原理，高耐壓與高電流功率元件之設計，高速與高頻半導體元件之製作等等各類常見之半導體電子元件應用。",
    "describe_eh": "All kinds of electronic devices theory and their application as well as measurement.  Si to compound semiconductor, optoelectronic devices, high breakdown voltage and high operation current devices, and Power devices will be the topics in this class.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
